{
  "schema": "wikijump_local_lab.wikidot_color_span_nested_preview_observations.v1",
  "description": "Anonymous, non-mutating Wikidot edit/PagePreviewModule observations on scp-wiki (2026-10-19) of inline syntax nested inside ##color|...## spans (issue #2567). Each record is a sealed wikijump_syntax_differential.wikidot_reference.v1 record (source, provenance, raw_html, sha256). The color-span-*, footnote-bold-no-color and superscript-plain records were captured with the at-raw set. Records from wikidot-color-span-raw-preview/ cover raw markers inside color spans.",
  "rules_established": [
    "A ##color|...## span body is ordinary inline wikitext: footnotes, ^^sup^^, ,,sub,,, //em//, --strike--, {{mono}}, @@raw@@, [[size]], [[span]], single and triple links all render inside <span style=\"color: ...\">.",
    "Raw `@@` inside a color span body pairs per Wikidot's raw rules, including with markers past the span close; Wikijump keeps the legacy literal rendering for bodies containing `@@` (records scp-102-vn-185, scp-9698-*, time-reprise-*, scp-6276-265, color-odd-raw-then-later-raw)."
  ],
  "source_sealed_directory": "~/.local/state/wikijump/issue-acceptance-claude-20261019/wikidot-color-span-nested-preview/",
